  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "fix(ssh2): Fix bn_cookie_ht dup'ed too early",
  "description": "This is a small fix for an issue that was introduced in !10441 (mea culpa!). Not sure why I didn't catch this bug during my tests though, maybe I accidentally built off an old commit. The `bn_cookie` file scoped bignum is being copied too early into the glib allocated member `bn_cookie_ht` as it hasn't been populated yet. This is due to the key material (and not the cookie) being converted first. A simple swap of both memory copy blocks resolves this issue.",
